Proposed (51.1s): Use this skill to generate or update the README.md for a specific Sherpa RPA process/bot. Trigger when the user asks to create, write, make, update, or regenerate a README for an RPA process module (ics*, rps-*, ipe) under rpa-suite, or to "document the bot", "describe the process", or list its steps, orchestrator assets, and service variables — in English or Russian, even when the word "README" is not used. The skill analyzes .process files, Java step classes, init_params, email templates, and service variables to produce an accurate README. Do NOT use for full HTML documentation sets (PDD/UG/TD) — use write_documentation; for READMEs of non-RPA projects (Python pet projects, rpa-core library); or ordinary Javadoc. Only for individual Sherpa RPA process modules.

